  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/v2L4cwE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"769\" height=\"236\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>此模組需要 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Geckolib</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/idj408P.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">《生物圖鑑》模組引入了兩種新的生物類型，並擴展了一種現有的生物類型，分別是「詛咒生物」、「野獸」與「魔像」。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每種生物都擁有獨特的特性和遊戲玩法差異，但有一點相同：牠們都可以透過某種方式被馴服。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若想了解更多新增內容的詳細資訊，你可以合成《生物圖鑑》這本書，其中記載了所有關於這些新生物的關鍵資訊——</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些生物如今正漫遊在你的世界中！</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/wpPsdEq.png\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/wpPsdEq.png\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/qsKECAp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"58\"></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/Pf4GA5p.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"421\" height=\"232\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/2Ixe7wH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/GguoOYW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"58\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/1CZo9vf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"231\"><br><br></div><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/ukMAO2B.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"334\" height=\"69\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/YBTQDRo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"231\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/qWcLnAC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"231\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TeamBK/membership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Uu0E3Gl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"114\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Qch9Byuybb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/32oE3jv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"217\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
